    "G10H2210/491": {
      "code": "G10H2210/491",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G10H2210/471",
      "ja": "平均全音律音階，すなわち，多量の平均律の完全五度からすべての非オクターブ間隔が生成されるもの；長三度と短三度に適切なサイズを選択することによってシントニックコンマがユニゾンに調律される，例．Ａｌｅｍｂｅｒｔ修正中全音律",
      "en": "Meantone scales, i.e. in which all non-octave intervals are generated from a stack of tempered perfect fifths; and wherein, by choosing an appropriate size for major and minor thirds, the syntonic comma is tempered to unison, e.g. quarter comma meantone, syntonic comma, d&apos;Alembert modified meantone",
      "count": 9,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G10H2210/491",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G10H.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "G10H2210/496": {
      "code": "G10H2210/496",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G10H2210/471",
      "ja": "レッドフィールド音階，すなわち，オクターブ当たり１２間隔，（２＊＊ｐ）＊（３＊＊ｑ）＊（５＊＊ｒ）と等しい音色比に基づく，ｐ，ｑ，ｒは正または負の整数",
      "en": "Redfield scales, i.e. 12 intervals per octave, based on note ratios equal to (2**p)*(3**q)*(5**r) with p, q, r positive or negative integers",
      "count": 1,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "G10H2210/496",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_G10H.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
